{"id":"4159f39f01c9040e","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/506_Church_论题系统_CT.md","title":"506 Church 论题系统 CT","display":"506_Church_论题系统_CT","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{506}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{506}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项使用五个不同构造标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{succ},\\operatorname{add},\\operatorname{mul}\">\\(\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{succ},\\operatorname{add},\\operatorname{mul}\\)</span>，显示为变量、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\">\\(+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot\">\\(\\cdot\\)</span>。公式使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{phi},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex}\">\\(\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{phi},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex}\\)</span> 八个不同构造标签，显示为等词、三元递归图原子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lor\">\\(\\lor\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\">\\(\\forall\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists\">\\(\\exists\\)</span>。以下闭包子句给出每个构造子的参数类型；句法对象按带标签树字面相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span> 是由下列条件生成的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"St\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(St\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t+u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(t+u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\cdot u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(t\\cdot u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 是由下列条件生成的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(t=u\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,x,y)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\land B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A\\land B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A\\lor B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\forall xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\">\\(x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\exists xA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价\">3. 自由变量、替换与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{506})\">\\(\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{506})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{506}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{506})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{506}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{506})\\)</span>。项与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 原子均没有绑定者；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x,\\exists x\">\\(\\forall x,\\exists x\\)</span> 只绑定公式体中的自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(St)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(x)=\\{x\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(0)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(St)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t+u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t\\cdot u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(u).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t+u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(u),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t\\cdot u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(u).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(u),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(t=u)=\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(u),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(e)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(x)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(e)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(x)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>绑定变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{506}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{506}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{506}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Var}_{506}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(t=u)=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\Phi(e,x,y))=\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A\\land B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(B),\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A\\lor B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\forall xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(\\exists xA)=\\operatorname{BV}_{506}(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>项替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Subt}_{506}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\">\\(\\operatorname{Subt}_{506}:\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\to\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y[x:=t]=\n\\begin{cases}\nt,&amp;y=x,\\\\\ny,&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\n\\quad\n0[x:=t]=0,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(u+w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]+w[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(u\\cdot w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]\\cdot w[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(Su)[x:=t]=S(u[x:=t]),\n\\quad\n(u+w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]+w[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(u\\cdot w)[x:=t]=u[x:=t]\\cdot w[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式替换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{506}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{506}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 的非量词子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(u=w)[x:=t]=(u[x:=t]=w[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,u,w)[x:=t]=\\Phi(e[x:=t],u[x:=t],w[x:=t]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi(e,u,w)[x:=t]=\\Phi(e[x:=t],u[x:=t],w[x:=t]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bot[x:=t]=\\bot,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\land B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\land B[x:=t],\n\\quad\n(A\\lor B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\lor B[x:=t],\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A\\to B)[x:=t]=A[x:=t]\\to B[x:=t].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\)</span>，量词替换使用</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{fresh}_{506}(X)=v_m,\\quad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{fresh}_{506}(X)=v_m,\\quad m=\\min\\{i:v_i\\notin X\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并按下列三种情形定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=QyB\n\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=QyB\n\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=Qy(B[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=Qy(B[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(QyB)[x:=t]=Qz((B[y:=z])[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(QyB)[x:=t]=Qz((B[y:=z])[x:=t])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\in\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span> 且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{506}(\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{506}(\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{FVt}_{506}(t)\\cup\\{x,y\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E_{506}\">\\(\\mathcal E_{506}\\)</span> 为所有关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 的集合，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是等价关系，并满足下列封闭条件：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(B,B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((B,B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\land B,A&#39;\\land B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\lor B,A&#39;\\lor B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A\\to B,A&#39;\\to B&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A,A&#39;)\\in E\">\\((A,A&#39;)\\in E\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(QxA,QxA&#39;)\\in E\">\\((QxA,QxA&#39;)\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{506}(\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\cup\\{x\\})\">\\(z=\\operatorname{fresh}_{506}(\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\cup\\{x\\})\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(QxB,Qz(B[x:=z]))\\in E\">\\((QxB,Qz(B[x:=z]))\\in E\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\alpha,506}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{506}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_{\\alpha,506}=\\bigcap\\mathcal E_{506}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>自由改名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{506}(A,x,y)=A[x:=y]\">\\(\\operatorname{FreeRen}_{506}(A,x,y)=A[x:=y]\\)</span>；外层绑定改名为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{506}(QxA,y)=Qy(A[x:=y])\">\\(\\operatorname{BoundRen}_{506}(QxA,y)=Qy(A[x:=y])\\)</span>，定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x,y\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},y\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理族\">4. 公理族</h1>\n<p>直觉主义命题公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{506}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A)\\}\n\\cup\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{506}\n=\n\\{A\\to(B\\to A)\\}\n\\cup\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C))\\}\n\\cup\\{\\bot\\to A\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\\{A\\land B\\to A,\\ A\\land B\\to B,\\ A\\to(B\\to A\\land B)\\}\n\\cup\\{A\\to A\\lor B,\\ B\\to A\\lor B,\\ (A\\to C)\\to((B\\to C)\\to(A\\lor B\\to C))\\}\n\\cup\\{\\bot\\to A\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\">\\(A,B,C\\)</span> 全部取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>量词、等词与自然数公理族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{506}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{506}\n=\n\\{(\\forall xA)\\to A[x:=t],\\ A[x:=t]\\to\\exists xA:x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(A\\to\\forall xB):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A)\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(\\forall x(A\\to B))\\to(\\exists xA\\to B):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{506}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{506}\n=\n\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}\n\\cup\n\\{t=u\\to(A[x:=t]\\to A[x:=u]):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{506}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=(x\\cdot y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{506}\n=\n\\{Sx=0\\to\\bot,\\ Sx=Sy\\to x=y,\\ x+0=x,\\ x+Sy=S(x+y),\\ x\\cdot0=0,\\ x\\cdot Sy=(x\\cdot y)+x:x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\cup\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=Sx]))\\to\\forall xA):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\cup\n\\{A[x:=0]\\to((\\forall x(A\\to A[x:=Sx]))\\to\\forall xA):x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归图函数性族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiFun}^{506}\n=\n\\{\\Phi(e,x,y)\\to(\\Phi(e,x,z)\\to y=z):e,x,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiFun}^{506}\n=\n\\{\\Phi(e,x,y)\\to(\\Phi(e,x,z)\\to y=z):e,x,y,z\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>递归图可判定族以对象语言公式记录 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 原子处在可判定算术片段中，Church 论题公理使用同一个图谓词而不把每个指标断言为全函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiDec}^{506}\n=\n\\{\\Phi(e,x,y)\\lor(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\to\\bot):e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiDec}^{506}\n=\n\\{\\Phi(e,x,y)\\lor(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\to\\bot):e,x,y\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Church 论题族为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CTOK}_{506}(A,x,y,e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\ \\land\\\nx,y,e\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\ \\land\\\n|\\{x,y,e\\}|=3\\ \\land\\\ne\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CTOK}_{506}(A,x,y,e)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\ \\land\\\nx,y,e\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\ \\land\\\n|\\{x,y,e\\}|=3\\ \\land\\\ne\\notin\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,e\">\\(x,y,e\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi(e,x,y)\">\\(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\)</span> 中是同名自然数项；三者互异，且实现者变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中不自由出现，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists e\">\\(\\exists e\\)</span> 的引入不会捕获原公式参数。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{506}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,A)\\to\n\\exists e\\,\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\land A):\n\\operatorname{CTOK}_{506}(A,x,y,e)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{506}\n=\n\\{(\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,A)\\to\n\\exists e\\,\\forall x\\,\\exists y\\,(\\Phi(e,x,y)\\land A):\n\\operatorname{CTOK}_{506}(A,x,y,e)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{506}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{506}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiFun}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiDec}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{506}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{506}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{Q}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{=}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{N}^{506}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiFun}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiDec}^{506}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{506}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则、证明与可证性\">5. 规则、证明与可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{506}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{506}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{506}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\},\n\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{506}=\\{((A),\\forall xA):A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>两个规则分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}^2\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}^2\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}^1\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}^1\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span> 的子集，显示为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\\frac{A}{\\forall xA}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\frac{A\\quad A\\to B}{B},\\qquad\\frac{A}{\\forall xA}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ctx}_{506}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{506})\">\\(\\mathsf{Ctx}_{506}=\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Frm}_{506})\\)</span>，上下文按集合外延相等。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{506}\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{Ctx}_{506}\\)</span> 定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\Gamma=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\">\\(L_\\Gamma=\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{506}\\)</span>。候选证明为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:m\\to L_\\Gamma\">\\(\\pi:m\\to L_\\Gamma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N,m&gt;0\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N,m&gt;0\\)</span>，写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)=(\\Delta_i,A_i)\">\\(\\pi(i)=(\\Delta_i,A_i)\\)</span>。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span> 定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{506}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{506}\\land\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{506}\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\ (A_i=\\forall xA_j\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ (A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,506}A_i\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{LineOK}_{506}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\land\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{506}\\land\\Delta_i=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{506}\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}\\ (A_i=\\forall xA_j\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}\\operatorname{FV}_{506}(B)\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor\\exists j&lt;i\\ (A_j\\equiv_{\\alpha,506}A_i\\land\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>五分支是析取；每行至少具有一种理由。Gen 分支的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 必须是实际结论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall xA_j\">\\(\\forall xA_j\\)</span> 的绑定者；α 分支保留支持。没有未登记的行理由。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{506}(\\Gamma)=\\{\\pi:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ (m&gt;0\\land\\pi:m\\to L_\\Gamma\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{506}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Proof}_{506}(\\Gamma)=\\{\\pi:\\exists m\\in\\mathbb N\\ (m&gt;0\\land\\pi:m\\to L_\\Gamma\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{506}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{506}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{506}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{last}_{506}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{last}_{506}(\\pi)=(\\Delta_{m-1},A_{m-1}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{506}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{506}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{506}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{506}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{506}(\\Gamma)\\ \\exists\\Delta\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\ \\operatorname{last}_{506}(\\pi)=(\\Delta,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-目标区分\">6. 目标区分</h1>\n<p>本条目的目标增量是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 原子、函数性族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiFun}^{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiFun}^{506}\\)</span>、递归图可判定族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiDec}^{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{PhiDec}^{506}\\)</span> 与 Church 论题族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{506}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{CT}^{506}\\)</span>；不加入 Markov 族。</p>\n<p>本版本是授权修复候选，未继承原文评级。只修复公理实例域与五理由证书接受层；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span> 仍是带函数性和对象语言可判定性公理的原始三元符号，不因修复而获得机器语义或新增总性公理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-整个句法形式系统\">7. 整个句法形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{CT}_{506}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{506},\\mathsf{Tm}_{506},\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506},\\operatorname{FV}_{506},\\operatorname{BV}_{506},\\operatorname{Subt}_{506},\\operatorname{Sub}_{506},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,506},\\operatorname{CTOK}_{506},\\mathsf{Ax}_{506},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{506},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{506},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{506},\\operatorname{LineOK}_{506},\\mathsf{Proof}_{506},\\vdash_{506}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{CT}_{506}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{Var}_{506},\\mathsf{Tm}_{506},\\mathsf{Frm}_{506},\n\\operatorname{FVt}_{506},\\operatorname{FV}_{506},\\operatorname{BV}_{506},\\operatorname{Subt}_{506},\\operatorname{Sub}_{506},\n\\equiv_{\\alpha,506},\\operatorname{CTOK}_{506},\\mathsf{Ax}_{506},\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{506},\\mathsf{Rule}_{Gen}^{506},\n\\mathsf{Ctx}_{506},\\operatorname{LineOK}_{506},\\mathsf{Proof}_{506},\\vdash_{506}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含算术句法、递归图原子、Church 论题公理族、规则、证明对象和可证性；不含机器模型、函数语义、满足、真值或有效性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量、替换与-$\\alpha$-等价","text":"3. 自由变量、替换与 $\\alpha$-等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理族","text":"4. 公理族","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则、证明与可证性","text":"5. 规则、证明与可证性","level":1},{"id":"6.-目标区分","text":"6. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"7.-整个句法形式系统","text":"7. 整个句法形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\n\\{Y\\subseteq X:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to X\\ (Y=\\operatorname{rng}(e))\\},\n\\quad\n\\mathsf{Var}_{506}=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{var},\\operatorname{zero},\\operatorname{succ},\\operatorname{add},\\operatorname{mul}","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"+","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{phi},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{and},\\operatorname{or},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{all},\\operatorname{ex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\land","display":false},{"tex":"\\lor","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Var}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"0\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"St\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"t+u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"t,u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","display":false},{"tex":"t\\cdot u\\in\\mathsf{Tm}_{506}","